      ],
      "explanation": "Since \\(97=100-3\\), subtract three groups of \\(103\\) from one hundred groups of \\(103\\):\n\\[\n103\\times97=103(100-3)=10300-309=9991.\n\\]\nThe product is \\(9991\\).",
